#: ae268ccdd6d548cd8bbdbc84286e3f7f
msgid "TKOFF\\_THR\\_MINSPD: Takeoff throttle min speed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:243
#: c11161070efb45a98a2c58e36dab8a14
msgid "Minimum GPS ground speed in m\\/s used by the speed check that un\\-suppresses throttle in auto\\-takeoff\\. This can be be used for catapult launches where you want the motor to engage only after the plane leaves the catapult\\, but it is preferable to use the TKOFF\\_THR\\_MINACC and TKOFF\\_THR\\_DELAY parameters for catapult launches due to the errors associated with GPS measurements\\. For hand launches with a pusher prop it is strongly advised that this parameter be set to a value no less than 4 m\\/s to provide additional protection against premature motor start\\. Note that the GPS velocity will lag the real velocity by about 0\\.5 seconds\\. The ground speed check is delayed by the TKOFF\\_THR\\_DELAY parameter\\."
msgstr ""

