msgid "0 to 16"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:2243
#: 853713e0b419407cb6d1b8146df74ee4
msgid "RTL\\_AUTOLAND: RTL auto land"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:2246
#: 8ef5485a38c54a16bec3b39764594fe1
msgid "Automatically begin landing sequence after arriving at RTL location\\. This requires the addition of a DO\\_LAND\\_START mission item\\, which acts as a marker for the start of a landing sequence\\. The closest landing sequence will be chosen to the current location For a value of 1 a rally point will be used instead of HOME if in range \\(see rally point documentation\\)\\.If this is set to 0 and there is a DO\\_LAND\\_START or DO\\_RETURN\\_PATH\\_START mission item then you will get an arming check failure\\. You can set to a value of 3 to avoid the arming check failure and use the DO\\_LAND\\_START for go\\-around \\(see wiki for aborting autolandings\\) without it changing RTL behaviour\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:2257
#: bb9a8bed89f44380aad0db07a5a840fe
msgid "Fly HOME then land via DO_LAND_START mission item"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:2259
#: 7a4ba4ed56dc44778872721ebe580c5b
msgid "Go directly to landing sequence via DO_LAND_START mission item"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:2261
#: 144ce738b04642998589a91bd3a257c5
msgid "OnlyForGoAround"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:2263
#: 2f33aa18b52442b7a91b94e4143f769a
msgid "Go directly to landing sequence via DO_RETURN_PATH_START mission item"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:2274
#: c4436d002203419095a97a9d63942a2d
msgid "CRASH\\_ACC\\_THRESH: Crash Deceleration Threshold"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:2278
#: d14da21f08a449f2bf4034bff430308b
msgid "X\\-Axis deceleration threshold to notify the crash detector that there was a possible impact which helps disarm the motor quickly after a crash\\. This value should be much higher than normal negative x\\-axis forces during normal flight\\, check flight log files to determine the average IMU\\.x values for your aircraft and motor type\\. Higher value means less sensitive \\(triggers on higher impact\\)\\. For electric planes that don\\'t vibrate much during fight a value of 25 is good \\(that\\'s about 2\\.5G\\)\\. For petrol\\/nitro planes you\\'ll want a higher value\\. Set to 0 to disable the collision detector\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:2284
#: c7e53669ca7d4eb1a3c2804739d8f0fd
msgid "10 to 127"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:2293
#: 989f6ce783844f1cab9619a2de158d7b
msgid "CRASH\\_DETECT: Crash Detection"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:2297
#: 3077b1543ce645009327f68a57c9d869
msgid "Automatically detect a crash during AUTO flight and perform the bitmask selected action\\(s\\)\\. Disarm will turn off motor for safety and to help against burning out ESC and motor\\. Set to 0 to disable crash detection\\."
msgstr ""

