#: 6a0fde9a5c9946a28f630620a96d4eaa
msgid "AFS\\_HB\\_PIN: Heartbeat Pin"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:3523
#: 7ce72da57c21469cae319652f1489c44
