msgid "Allow arm\\/disarm by rudder input\\. When enabled arming can be done with right rudder\\, disarming with left rudder\\. Rudder arming only works with throttle at zero \\+\\- deadzone \\(RCx\\_DZ\\)\\. Depending on vehicle type\\, arming in certain modes is prevented\\. See the wiki for each vehicle\\. Caution is recommended when arming if it is allowed in an auto\\-throttle mode\\!"
