msgid "EK3\\_VIS\\_VERR\\_MIN: Visual odometry minimum velocity error"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:41011
#: 55989ac63b9b4227bff7ef9bc5bcace0
msgid "This is the 1\\-STD odometry velocity observation error that will be assumed when maximum quality is reported by the sensor\\. When quality is between max and min\\, the error will be calculated using linear interpolation between VIS\\_VERR\\_MIN and VIS\\_VERR\\_MAX\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:41017
#: c4ed489e12c74d2e9bd7484b54b3e464
msgid "0.05 to 0.5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:41026
#: c14912a5a58849a0a599f9c8c8d70e00
msgid "EK3\\_VIS\\_VERR\\_MAX: Visual odometry maximum velocity error"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:41030
#: 267031fe77044f8fb9ac84dd625a9461
msgid "This is the 1\\-STD odometry velocity observation error that will be assumed when minimum quality is reported by the sensor\\. When quality is between max and min\\, the error will be calculated using linear interpolation between VIS\\_VERR\\_MIN and VIS\\_VERR\\_MAX\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:41045
#: 9575a737595e45b3964000de490ceb8f
msgid "EK3\\_WENC\\_VERR: Wheel odometry velocity error"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:41049
#: 12db268292f34b149e688f28dc432fcf
msgid "This is the 1\\-STD odometry velocity observation error that will be assumed when wheel encoder data is being fused\\."
msgstr ""

