#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51500
#: 4ac906948b8a4a138bf8f5ce42769aac
msgid "LAND\\_ Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51506
#: c406c31daa5e4931b4f676ee045b7b78
msgid "LAND\\_SLOPE\\_RCALC: Landing slope re\\-calc threshold"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51510
#: 0066084fc1e74819b692eca501394755
msgid "This parameter is used when using a rangefinder during landing for altitude correction from baro drift \\(RNGFND\\_LANDING\\=1\\) and the altitude correction indicates your altitude is lower than the intended slope path\\. This value is the threshold of the correction to re\\-calculate the landing approach slope\\. Set to zero to keep the original slope all the way down and any detected baro drift will be corrected by pitching\\/throttling up to snap back to resume the original slope path\\. Otherwise\\, when a rangefinder altitude correction exceeds this threshold it will trigger a slope re\\-calculate to give a shallower slope\\. This also smoothes out the approach when flying over objects such as trees\\. Recommend a value of 2m\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51525
#: 5cb7439ca5dd4b26836ecdd2228482fd
msgid "LAND\\_ABORT\\_DEG: Landing auto\\-abort slope threshold"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51529
#: d3cf2e9a23b1473fb36c61adbaa5fe8c
msgid "This parameter is used when using a rangefinder during landing for altitude correction from baro drift \\(RNGFND\\_LANDING\\=1\\) and the altitude correction indicates your actual altitude is higher than the intended slope path\\. Normally it would pitch down steeply but that can result in a crash with high airspeed so this allows remembering the baro offset and self\\-abort the landing and come around for another landing with the correct baro offset applied for a perfect slope\\. An auto\\-abort go\\-around will only happen once\\, next attempt will not auto\\-abort again\\. This operation happens entirely automatically in AUTO mode\\. This value is the delta degrees threshold to trigger the go\\-around compared to the original slope\\. Example\\: if set to 5 deg and the mission planned slope is 15 deg then if the new slope is 21 then it will go\\-around\\. Set to 0 to disable\\. Requires LAND\\_SLOPE\\_RCALC \\> 0\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51544
#: cbfee56fa45e450b8adc347d1577493d
msgid "LAND\\_PITCH\\_DEG: Landing Pitch"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51548
#: b1dcc7ddc3b049a482aa62190e300b13
msgid "Used in autoland to give the minimum pitch in the final stage of landing \\(after the flare\\)\\. This parameter can be used to ensure that the final landing attitude is appropriate for the type of undercarriage on the aircraft\\. Note that it is a minimum pitch only \\- the landing code will control pitch above this value to try to achieve the configured landing sink rate\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51554
#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:83083
#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:83102
#: 75d6e43a00cd412ebda45ba30cccf8f1
#: d8cbad3315b244c0973a3cc55e153714
#: bfffeb653fa2489598cc1fa5ecefa7a3
msgid "-20 to 20"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51563
#: 503308e912f44754b3cf4533e08cdbe8
msgid "LAND\\_FLARE\\_ALT: Landing flare altitude"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51567
#: 97d9626a860f4b098b2663a35db508b2
msgid "Altitude in autoland at which to lock heading and flare to the LAND\\_PITCH\\_DEG pitch\\. Note that this option is secondary to LAND\\_FLARE\\_SEC\\. For a good landing it preferable that the flare is triggered by LAND\\_FLARE\\_SEC\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51582
#: f9b5a86f67fd46a69da5b419edfa4517
msgid "LAND\\_FLARE\\_SEC: Landing flare time"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51586
#: 483463dc59df4934a815f488b7bea659
msgid "Vertical time before landing point at which to lock heading and flare with the motor stopped\\. This is vertical time\\, and is calculated based solely on the current height above the ground and the current descent rate\\.  Set to 0 if you only wish to flare based on altitude \\(see LAND\\_FLARE\\_ALT\\)\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51601
#: 29cd770e65cd40bea809758d33abb7d7
msgid "LAND\\_PF\\_ALT: Landing pre\\-flare altitude"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51605
#: 6b7e2d24fb24462eaa83a42879ce12e6
msgid "Altitude to trigger pre\\-flare flight stage where LAND\\_PF\\_ARSPD controls airspeed\\. The pre\\-flare flight stage trigger works just like LAND\\_FLARE\\_ALT but higher\\. Disabled when LAND\\_PF\\_ARSPD is 0\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51620
#: 2f4bebb779fa45aa9c9907a095fa3ace
msgid "LAND\\_PF\\_SEC: Landing pre\\-flare time"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51624
#: ee842020cd3d412789329dc03dc30b1d
msgid "Vertical time to ground to trigger pre\\-flare flight stage where LAND\\_PF\\_ARSPD controls airspeed\\. This pre\\-flare flight stage trigger works just like LAND\\_FLARE\\_SEC but earlier\\. Disabled when LAND\\_PF\\_ARSPD is 0\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51639
#: cf3f37e80dfc4aa481d7b17730000803
msgid "LAND\\_PF\\_ARSPD: Landing pre\\-flare airspeed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51643
#: 68ff2897dd1f4dd797537207beb7fb85
msgid "Desired airspeed during pre\\-flare flight stage\\. This is useful to reduce airspeed just before the flare\\. Use 0 to disable\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51658
#: 17732f1156514c8fa8bf9bb778a9e2b8
msgid "LAND\\_THR\\_SLEW: Landing throttle slew rate"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51661
#: 6ca3f5650a4646ec8050612211f6ea32
msgid "This parameter sets the slew rate for the throttle during auto landing\\. When this is zero the THR\\_SLEWRATE parameter is used during landing\\. The value is a percentage throttle change per second\\, so a value of 20 means to advance the throttle over 5 seconds on landing\\. Values below 50 are not recommended as it may cause a stall when airspeed is low and you can not throttle up fast enough\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51676
#: d77b045c279a4bf783660b6d4d3db274
msgid "LAND\\_DISARMDELAY: Landing disarm delay"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51680
