msgid "QWIK\\_REDUCE\\_MAX: Quicktune maximum gain reduction"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:84130
#: 97ce5c5dd30340d0b25911bd16a9d03b
msgid "This controls how much quicktune is allowed to lower gains from the original gains\\. If the vehicle already has a reasonable tune and is not oscillating then you can set this to zero to prevent gain reductions\\. The default of 20\\% is reasonable for most vehicles\\. Using a maximum gain reduction lowers the chance of an angle P oscillation happening if quicktune gets a false positive oscillation at a low gain\\, which can result in very low rate gains and a dangerous angle P oscillation\\."
msgstr ""

