msgid "Auto takeoff \\(in Auto or Guided\\) is not permitted until motors report no more than this RPM\\. Set to zero to disable check\\. Q\\_TKOFF\\_RPM\\_MIN must also be set to a non\\-zero value to enable this check\\."
msgstr ""

