#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:109759
#: d362ceb57c4c466e88851c6e141b35f4
msgid "DShot ESC type for all outputs\\. The ESC type affects the range of DShot commands available and the bit widths used\\. None means that no dshot commands will be executed\\. Some ESC types support Extended DShot Telemetry \\(EDT\\) which allows telemetry other than RPM data to be returned when using bi\\-directional dshot\\. If you enable EDT you must install EDT capable firmware for correct operation\\."
